"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"REALIA:5.1\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">5.1</span> 標題：油燈和燈心（Oil lamp and wick）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： מָאוֹר</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： ma’or)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02025006\" data-end-ref=\"02025006\">EXO 25:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02027020\" data-end-ref=\"02027020\">EXO 27:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02035008\" data-end-ref=\"02035008\">EXO 35:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02035014\" data-end-ref=\"02035014\">EXO 35:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02035014\" data-end-ref=\"02035014\">EXO 35:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02035028\" data-end-ref=\"02035028\">EXO 35:28</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02039037\" data-end-ref=\"02039037\">EXO 39:37</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03024002\" data-end-ref=\"03024002\">LEV 24:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04004009\" data-end-ref=\"04004009\">NUM 4:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04004016\" data-end-ref=\"04004016\">NUM 4:16</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： נִיר</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： nir)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11011036\" data-end-ref=\"11011036\">1KI 11:36</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11015004\" data-end-ref=\"11015004\">1KI 15:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12008019\" data-end-ref=\"12008019\">2KI 8:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14021007\" data-end-ref=\"14021007\">2CH 21:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20021004\" data-end-ref=\"20021004\">PRO 21:4</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： נֵר</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： ner)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02025037\" data-end-ref=\"02025037\">EXO 25:37</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02025037\" data-end-ref=\"02025037\">EXO 25:37</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02027020\" data-end-ref=\"02027020\">EXO 27:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02030007\" data-end-ref=\"02030007\">EXO 30:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02030008\" data-end-ref=\"02030008\">EXO 30:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02035014\" data-end-ref=\"02035014\">EXO 35:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02037023\" data-end-ref=\"02037023\">EXO 37:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02039037\" data-end-ref=\"02039037\">EXO 39:37</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02039037\" data-end-ref=\"02039037\">EXO 39:37</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02040004\" data-end-ref=\"02040004\">EXO 40:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02040025\" data-end-ref=\"02040025\">EXO 40:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03024002\" data-end-ref=\"03024002\">LEV 24:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03024004\" data-end-ref=\"03024004\">LEV 24:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04004009\" data-end-ref=\"04004009\">NUM 4:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04008002\" data-end-ref=\"04008002\">NUM 8:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04008002\" data-end-ref=\"04008002\">NUM 8:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04008003\" data-end-ref=\"04008003\">NUM 8:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09003003\" data-end-ref=\"09003003\">1SA 3:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10021017\" data-end-ref=\"10021017\">2SA 21:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10022029\" data-end-ref=\"10022029\">2SA 22:29</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11007049\" data-end-ref=\"11007049\">1KI 7:49</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13028015\" data-end-ref=\"13028015\">1CH 28:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13028015\" data-end-ref=\"13028015\">1CH 28:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13028015\" data-end-ref=\"13028015\">1CH 28:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14004020\" data-end-ref=\"14004020\">2CH 4:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14004021\" data-end-ref=\"14004021\">2CH 4:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14013011\" data-end-ref=\"14013011\">2CH 13:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14029007\" data-end-ref=\"14029007\">2CH 29:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18018006\" data-end-ref=\"18018006\">JOB 18:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18021017\" data-end-ref=\"18021017\">JOB 21:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18029003\" data-end-ref=\"18029003\">JOB 29:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19018029\" data-end-ref=\"19018029\">PSA 18:29</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19119105\" data-end-ref=\"19119105\">PSA 119:105</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19132017\" data-end-ref=\"19132017\">PSA 132:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20006023\" data-end-ref=\"20006023\">PRO 6:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20013009\" data-end-ref=\"20013009\">PRO 13:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20020020\" data-end-ref=\"20020020\">PRO 20:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20020027\" data-end-ref=\"20020027\">PRO 20:27</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20024020\" data-end-ref=\"20024020\">PRO 24:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20031018\" data-end-ref=\"20031018\">PRO 31:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24025010\" data-end-ref=\"24025010\">JER 25:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"36001012\" data-end-ref=\"36001012\">ZEP 1:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"38004002\" data-end-ref=\"38004002\">ZEC 4:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"38004002\" data-end-ref=\"38004002\">ZEC 4:2</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： λύχνος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： luchnos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40005015\" data-end-ref=\"40005015\">MAT 5:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006022\" data-end-ref=\"40006022\">MAT 6:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41004021\" data-end-ref=\"41004021\">MRK 4:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42008016\" data-end-ref=\"42008016\">LUK 8:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42011034\" data-end-ref=\"42011034\">LUK 11:34</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42011036\" data-end-ref=\"42011036\">LUK 11:36</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42012035\" data-end-ref=\"42012035\">LUK 12:35</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42015008\" data-end-ref=\"42015008\">LUK 15:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43005035\" data-end-ref=\"43005035\">JHN 5:35</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61001019\" data-end-ref=\"61001019\">2PE 1:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66018023\" data-end-ref=\"66018023\">REV 18:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66021023\" data-end-ref=\"66021023\">REV 21:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66022005\" data-end-ref=\"66022005\">REV 22:5</data>, SIR 26:17, LJE 1:18, 1MA 4:50, 2MA 1:8, 2MA 10:3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉： lucerna</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 12:42, 2ES 14:25</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉： lumen</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 10:2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<h3 class=\"thlex-subheading\">\n          <strong>燈心</strong> ：</h3>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： פִּשְׁתָּה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： pishtah)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23042003\" data-end-ref=\"23042003\">ISA 42:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23043017\" data-end-ref=\"23043017\">ISA 43:17</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： λίνον</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： linon)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40012020\" data-end-ref=\"40012020\">MAT 12:20</data></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>\n            <figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0940_oil_lamps.jpg\" alt=\"油燈，羅馬時期\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">油燈，羅馬時期 (© Combirom2 Wikimedia Commons)</figcaption></figure>油燈是一種照明工具，在一個較小的容器中裝著燈油，裡面浸著一根燈心，燈心燃燒就發出光來。容器呈橢圓形，通常由黏土製成。油燈大小不一，家用油燈的尺寸通常約為13×8×4厘米（5×3×1.5英吋）。油燈有幾種樣式，其中一種是裝著油的淺盤子，油上面漂著一根燈心。另外一種尺寸差不多，然而是封閉式的，油不會灑出來，便於攜帶。這種油燈的頂部有兩個孔，小孔用來插燈心，大孔用來添油。燈心通常由亞麻線做成。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">用途</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>\n            <figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0472_lamp.jpg\" alt=\"羅馬時期油燈\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">羅馬時期油燈 (© Davidbena, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons)</figcaption></figure>燈身裡面盛滿油，燈心浸在油裡面。燈心會燒焦，因此需要定期修剪。油燈的照明面積很小。根據油的質量和燈心的質地及長短，油燈發出的光和煙也不同。橄欖油是最常用的燈油，但在很早的時候，人們也使用魚油。（關於橄欖油的其他用途，另參<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">1.10.5 膏油 (anointing oil)&lt;REALIA:1.10.5&gt;</a> 、<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">1.15.1 油、油膏 (oil, ointment)&lt;REALIA:1.15.1&gt;</a> 和<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">9.3 橄欖油 (olive oil)&lt;REALIA:9.3&gt;</a> 。）</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻譯</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>在有些語言中，與「油燈」最接近的對等詞是「煤油燈」。翻譯者應避免使用表示手電筒或任何電燈的詞語，因為這是嚴重的時代錯誤。可以譯為「燈籠」或「燈」。蠟燭也是一個合適的文化對等物，其原理與油燈相同，只是燃燒的是固態物，不是油。蠟燭雖然沒有在聖經中提到過，但在古代就已經有了。</p>\n<p>「燈」的作用是發光，因此在經文中有時用作比喻。希伯來文<em>nir</em> 和希臘文<em>lucerna</em> 在相關經文中都是作為比喻使用。希伯來文<em>ner</em> 用來喻指以色列的王（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10021017\" data-end-ref=\"10021017\">2SA 21:17</data> ）、上帝，或者與上帝相關的一些事物，例如他的保護、引領、祝福或話語（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10022029\" data-end-ref=\"10022029\">2SA 22:29</data> ；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18021017\" data-end-ref=\"18021017\">JOB 21:17</data> ；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19018029\" data-end-ref=\"19018029\">PSA 18:29</data> ［《和》18:28］，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19119105\" data-end-ref=\"19119105\">PSA 119:105</data> ；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20006023\" data-end-ref=\"20006023\">PRO 6:23</data> ）、生或死（生命的熄滅；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18018006\" data-end-ref=\"18018006\">JOB 18:6</data> ，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18021017\" data-end-ref=\"18021017\">JOB 21:17</data> ；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19132017\" data-end-ref=\"19132017\">PSA 132:17</data> ；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20013009\" data-end-ref=\"20013009\">PRO 13:9</data> ，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20020020\" data-end-ref=\"20020020\">PRO 20:20</data> ，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20024020\" data-end-ref=\"20024020\">PRO 24:20</data> ）、人的靈（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20020027\" data-end-ref=\"20020027\">PRO 20:27</data> ）、平安或正常狀態（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24025010\" data-end-ref=\"24025010\">JER 25:10</data> ），以及徹底（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"36001012\" data-end-ref=\"36001012\">ZEP 1:12</data> ）。希臘文<em>luchnos</em> 喻指人的領悟（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006022\" data-end-ref=\"40006022\">MAT 6:22</data> ；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42011034\" data-end-ref=\"42011034\">LUK 11:34</data> ，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42011036\" data-end-ref=\"42011036\">LUK 11:36</data> ）、准备就緒（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42012035\" data-end-ref=\"42012035\">LUK 12:35</data> ）、先知的聲音（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43005035\" data-end-ref=\"43005035\">JHN 5:35</data> ），以及人的面容（SIR 26:17 ）。</p>\n<p>「燈」經常用來比喻人的生命；例如，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised Standard Version (1952)\">RSV</abbr> 在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18021017\" data-end-ref=\"18021017\">JOB 21:17</data> 的英文意為，「惡人的燈有多少次熄滅過？」《〈約伯記〉手冊》（<em>A Handbook on The Book of Job</em> ，第398頁）指出，這行經文說的是早逝或意外死亡。</p>\n<p>在一些經文中，燈發出亮光喻指人在生活中經歷上帝的引領，通常是藉著他的話語。<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19119105\" data-end-ref=\"19119105\">PSA 119:105</data> 就是一個例子，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New International Version (1984)\">NIV</abbr> 在這一節的英文意為，「你的話是我腳前的燈，是我路上的光。」</p>\n<p>有些時候，雖然翻譯者會認同某段經文是比喻性的，但關於比喻的確切內容是什麼，他們卻並不一定能夠達成一致意見；例如，關於<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18029003\" data-end-ref=\"18029003\">JOB 29:3</data> 中的燈喻指什麼，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 和<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"German Common Language Version (Gute Nachricht Bibel)\">GECL</abbr> 的理解就不一樣。這行經文的原文字面意思是，「當他的燈照在我的頭上」（如<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised Standard Version (1952)\">RSV</abbr> ），<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 英文意為「那時上帝一直與我同在」，而<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"German Common Language Version (Gute Nachricht Bibel)\">GECL</abbr> 則為「他每日都賜我以順遂」。</p>\n<p>關於<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24025010\" data-end-ref=\"24025010\">JER 25:10</data> ，參<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">5.10 磨、磨石、磨盤 (millstones, mill)&lt;REALIA:5.10&gt;</a> 中的註解。</p>\n<p>在翻譯<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23042003\" data-end-ref=\"23042003\">ISA 42:3</data> 中的希伯來文<em>pishtah</em> 時，比較正式的譯本直譯為「燈心」；例如，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised Standard Version (1952)\">RSV</abbr> 英文意為「微明的燈心，他不熄滅」。通俗譯本通常會避免使用這種大眾不容易理解的字面翻譯，以下是幾個很好的範例：「他必不吹滅搖曳的燈盞」（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 直譯），「他不會撲滅將滅的火苗」（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Contemporary English Version\">CEV</abbr> 直譯），「即使是微弱的火苗，他也必不熄滅」（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New Century Version\">NCV</abbr> 直譯）。如果翻譯者希望保留燈心的比喻，可以將這個詞譯為「小布條」。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
